type: software
title: "corpus-assay: benchmark contamination detection for LLM training corpora"
abstract: >-
  Fast, auditable n-gram detection of evaluation-benchmark contamination in LLM
  training corpora, with a Rust scanner and per-benchmark and per-item attribution.
authors:
  - family-names: May
    given-names: Victor
repository-code: "https://github.com/mrcabbage972/corpus-assay"
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-10-03"
# Zenodo archives every GitHub Release of this repository. Each release gets its own
# version DOI, and one concept DOI covers all versions (it resolves to the latest).
# The concept DOI goes in `doi:` once Zenodo has archived the first release (v0.1.0).
keywords:
  - large language models
  - evaluation
  - data contamination
  - decontamination
  - benchmarks
